 "sentences": [
  "Bees make honey from plant secretions.",
  "They collect sugary nectar or honeydew from plants and other insects.",
  "Refinement happens through enzymatic activity and regurgitation within the bees.",
  "Inside the hive, bees evaporate water from the mixture.",
  "This concentrates the sugars until the substance becomes thick and viscous.",
  "Finally, bees store this food in hexagonal beeswax structures called honeycomb."
